  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "When in a hurry, its legs lengthen progressively. It runs smoothly with extra long, loping strides.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "When in a hurry, its legs lengthen progressively. It runs smoothly with extra long, loping strides.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "When kicking, the sole of its foot turns as hard as a diamond on impact and destroys its enemy.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "This amazing POKéMON has an awesome sense of balance. It can kick in succession from any position.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it starts kicking repeatedly, both legs will stretch even longer to strike a fleeing foe.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is also called the Kick Master. It uses its elastic legs to execute every known kick.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "HITMONLEE’s legs freely contract and stretch. Using these springlike legs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its legs and loosens the muscles to overcome fatigue.",
